{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>A wild ass of a man.</b> A פֶּרֶא is a wild ass. He says that he will be an ass in temperament from his mother's Egyptian side, as it says of the Egyptians (Ezekiel 23:20): אֲשֶׁר בְּשַׂר חֲמוֹרִים בְּשָׂרָם, and that he will be a wild ass in that he dwells in the desert, as it says (Genesis 21:20): וַיִּגְדַּל וַיֵּשֶׁב בַּמִּדְבָּר, and that he will be a man from his father's side, as the Sages of blessed memory said (Bava Batra 16b) that Ishmael did repentance."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:20.942473012Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}